WEBVTT

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:01.855
of a social media propagandist
in Southern California.

00:01:02.386 --> 00:01:04.767
He was a married white guy
in his late 30s.

00:01:04.791 --> 00:01:07.973
He had a table in front of him
with a mug of coffee,

00:01:07.997 --> 00:01:09.567
a laptop for tweeting,

00:01:09.591 --> 00:01:11.439
a phone for texting

00:01:11.463 --> 00:01:14.699
and an iPad for livestreaming
to Periscope and YouTube.

00:01:15.258 --> 00:01:16.419
That was it.

00:01:16.998 --> 00:01:18.268
And yet, with those tools,

00:01:18.292 --> 00:01:22.007
he was able to propel his fringe,
noxious talking points

00:01:22.031 --> 00:01:24.442
into the heart of
the American conversation.

00:01:25.144 --> 00:01:27.167
For example, one of the days I was there,

00:01:27.191 --> 00:01:30.343
a bomb had just exploded in New York,